WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:19.043
Cora was an octopus.

2
00:00:19.044 --> 00:00:23.411
She loved living in Rainbow Reef.

3
00:00:23.412 --> 00:00:29.680
She had a nice den.

4
00:00:29.681 --> 00:00:37.998
She had many friends.

5
00:00:37.999 --> 00:00:42.023
Cora always tried to protect her friends.

6
00:00:42.024 --> 00:00:45.466
But it was hard sometimes.

7
00:00:45.467 --> 00:00:49.517
Hungry sharks hunted for food.

8
00:00:49.518 --> 00:00:54.037
Garbage floated in the water.

9
00:00:54.038 --> 00:00:58.605
Humans caught crabs and fish with nets.

10
00:00:58.606 --> 00:01:02.132
Cora sighed.

11
00:01:02.133 --> 00:01:10.680
"I wish I could keep everyone safe forever!"

12
00:01:10.681 --> 00:01:16.042
One day Cora was playing with Mo.

13
00:01:16.043 --> 00:01:23.649
He was her best friend.

14
00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:28.842
"Tag!" Cora said. "You're it!"

15
00:01:28.843 --> 00:01:32.824
"I'll get you!" Mo said.

16
00:01:32.825 --> 00:01:40.219
Mo chased Cora around a rock.

17
00:01:40.220 --> 00:01:43.743
But he was a porcupine fish.

18
00:01:43.744 --> 00:01:47.379
So he was slower than Cora.

19
00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:54.528
Mo sighed. "I give up—I can't catch you!"

20
00:01:54.529 --> 00:02:00.667
"Cora!" Just then a tiny shrimp swam over.

21
00:02:00.668 --> 00:02:05.150
"Sasha! What's wrong?" Cora asked.

22
00:02:05.151 --> 00:02:08.665
"I need your help!" Sasha said.

23
00:02:08.666 --> 00:02:11.583
Sasha looked worried.

24
00:02:11.584 --> 00:02:16.350
"A big, strong storm is coming!

25
00:02:16.351 --> 00:02:19.760
It will blow me away from the reef."

26
00:02:19.761 --> 00:02:29.296
Cora looked around.

27
00:02:29.297 --> 00:02:38.726
She saw dark clouds rolling toward them.

28
00:02:38.727 --> 00:02:45.263
On the seafloor, sand and shells were swirling.

29
00:02:45.264 --> 00:02:52.868
"Everyone, follow me!" Cora cried.

